---
layout: article
title: Monitors
description: Watch project usage and check endpoint availability with Appwrite Monitors. Configure alerts, choose who to notify, and track recovery in the Console.
---

Appwrite **Monitors** checks your project usage or an endpoint on a schedule. A monitor opens an alert when a usage condition is met or an endpoint check fails. You can choose who gets notified, escalate to more people until someone responds, and review when each alert fired and recovered.

You manage monitors and their alerts under **Observe** > **Monitors** in your project.

